@M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_CUSTOM_COM_K51_1(JoinIn)
	;Go Swimming.
#DIM DYNAMIC JoinIn
CALL D_LINE
IF TEQUIP:MASTER:900
	PRINTFORMDL You swim in the water with Nitori...
	PRINTW
	SELECTCASE RAND:4
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「It's no fun just treading water, right?」
			PRINTFORMDL Nitori swims circles around you, diving and surfacing with ease.
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORML 「Let's dive and look around!」
			PRINTFORMDL Nitori disappears under the surface.
			IF TALENT:MASTER:水棲
				PRINTFORMDL You swim after her and the two of you nimbly explore the bottom together.
			ELSEIF ITEM:避水の玉
				PRINTFORMDL You swim along with her using the %ITEMNAME_TR(406)%, exploring the bottom while she glides all around you.
			ELSEIF ITEM:空色の勾玉
				PRINTFORMDL You swim along with her using the %ITEMNAME_TR(920)%, exploring the bottom while she glides all around you.
			ELSEIF ITEM:酸素マスク
				PRINTFORMDL You swim along with her using the %ITEMNAME_TR(921)%, exploring the bottom while she glides all around you.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDL You try to follow her, but you keep having to come back up for air.
			ENDIF
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORMDL At some point, you lose track of where she is...
			IF !RAND:2
				PRINTFORML 「Boo!」
				PRINTFORMDL ...Until she pops up in front of you and splashes you with water.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDL ...Until she seizes you by the ankles and drags you underwater!
				PRINTFORMDL When you scramble your way back to the surface, she pops up in front of you with a sheepish smirk.
				PRINTFORML 「Sorry, did I scare you?」
			ENDIF
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORMDL Nitori lies on her back and drifts with the current.
			PRINTFORML 「Sometimes it's nice to just float around.」
			PRINTFORML 「Better not fall asleep, though...」
	ENDSELECT
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDL You and Nitori get out of the water...
	PRINTW
	SELECTCASE RAND:2
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「All done? I'll get out, too.」
		CASE 1
			IF TALENT:MASTER:水棲
				PRINTFORML 「It's fun going in the water with you.」
				PRINTFORMDL Nitori looks satisfied after swimming with a fellow aquatic.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「Can't stay too long in the water, huh?」
				PRINTFORMDL Nitori reluctantly follows you on land.
			ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
WAIT
RETURN 1

